+
+| User/plan requirement | Outcome and location | Actual source verification / unresolved limit |
+|---|---|---|
+| Pursue next useful underlying-record route | README sections1/assessment | Actual public parent Control Numbers gives exact schedule and accession. This is catalog evidence; transfer dossier itself is still missing. |
+| Reuse holdings; avoid repeated completed searches | Protocol; README scope | Started from exact previously exposed parent; original PDF not downloaded again; current read is a previously unperformed UI route. Existing selected reports/pins searched for exact accession; no match in that bounded set, not a universal novelty claim. |
+| Preserve conflicts, values, source levels and prior versions | README tables/sections2–5 | Counts, class/purpose/access/use/date labels retained separately; prior schedule report unchanged. No preferred class, cause or count reconciliation adopted. |
+| Exact URLs, hashes and locators | SOURCE-PINS | DOM capture hashes with original field headings and local physical line ranges. These are rendered representations, not HTTP-response/native source hashes. Prior original PDF hash/access/page reused with its actual scope. |
+| Full versus selected reading | README source scope | Parent description/control/copy-details and table pages1/11; child description/first ten titles only. No full104-folder,3,077-item or14,165-item audit; no item PDF or raw media read. |
+| Test assumption and retain disconfirming possibilities | README assessment; OPEN-RECORDS | Exact authority-label string match supports catalog-level association. Different count levels and permanent-original rule limit wrongdoing inference; actual preservation compliance remains equally unknown. |
+| Missing inputs remain TODOs | OPEN-RECORDS | Named accession dossier, item/copy/count/readability records and all substantive FAA outcomes remain unacquired. No closed gate or percentage of proof. |
+| Respect ownership and full goal | README final paragraphs | All five tracks/eighteen criteria unfinished; technical chat read as active, auditor notLoaded; no technical test duplicated or unauthorized message sent. |
+| Source/public/private boundaries | Six-file public bundle | Only original research notes, safe selected fields, checklist, diff and companion hashes. No raw DOM, scans/images/OCR, staff/contact/personal/account data, case correspondence or strategy. Native source snapshots retained separately. |
+| Revision accountability | REVISION.diff | Exact first-addition diff for four substantive note files against absent predecessor path. Earlier records not replaced. |
+| Publish accurately | Actual local Git/API receipts after push | Verify scoped AveLyra commit/auth/SSH/ref/body hashes; report draft-branch versus main publication separately. No inferred future push success from this checklist. |
+
+Mechanical prepublication review: recompute each held snapshot fingerprint; parse JSON; verify selected field values and line ranges against the exact preserved representations; compare native notes to redundant public copies; recompute manifest companion hashes; check additive diff parsing/applicability and actual staged blobs. These checks cover preservation and documentary matching, not historical completeness, cause, retention compliance, a scientific experiment or a substantive original-record gate. The actual outputs are retained in a separate local receipt.
